@show nanoha school_smile l
nanoha: "Excuse me. Mizuno-san?" || あの……みずのさん？  #c1_0186
> Nanoha's standing by my desk with her lunch held in front of her in both hands, the way she holds things when she's about to do something brave.  #c1_0187
natsuki<surprised>: "Oh—hi. You're…" || あ、どうも。えっと……  #c1_0188
nanoha<smile>: "Tachibana Nanoha. Um— I sit two rows over." || たちばななのはです。えっと……二列向こうの席です。  #c1_0189
nanoha<smile>: "If you'd like… I could show you around after school? The library, the music rooms. Which shoe lockers stick. Which vending machine eats coins. That kind of thing." || よかったら……放課後、校内を案内しましょうか？ 図書室とか、音楽室とか。どの下駄箱がひっかかるか。どの自販機がお金を食べるか。そういうのです。  #c1_0190
